@startuml Sequence Diagram - Prediksi
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Prediksi Risiko DBD\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor User
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(prediksi.py)" as flask
participant "ML Model\n(ml_model.py)" as ml
participant "Random Forest\nModel (.pkl)" as rf
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db

== Prediksi Risiko DBD ==

User -> Browser : 1: Buka halaman prediksi
Browser -> flask : 2: GET /prediksi/
flask --> Browser : 3: render_template('prediksi/index.html')
Browser --> User : 4: Tampilkan form input

User -> Browser : 5: Input data (bulan, kasus, usia, jk, lama_rawat)
Browser -> flask : 6: Submit (POST /prediksi/predict)
flask -> ml : 7: predict(bulan, jumlah_kasus, usia, jk, lama_rawat)
note left of ml : Note: Model Random Forest\ndengan n_estimators konfigurabel
note left of ml : Note: Hasil disimpan ke\ntabel hasil_prediksi
ml -> rf : 8: load_model()
rf --> ml : 9: return RF model
ml -> ml : 10: prepare_features()
ml -> rf : 11: model.predict(features)
rf --> ml : 12: return tingkat_risiko, confidence
ml --> flask : 13: return prediction_result
flask -> db : 14: save(HasilPrediksi)
db --> flask : 15: return success
flask --> Browser : 16: return JSON response
Browser --> User : 17: Tampilkan hasil prediksi

@enduml
